<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89789" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσοδ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>accrue</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθαρμοὺς ἐκ
				ποικίλων θεωρημάτων προσοδεύσαντας</span> the
			<i>product</i> of reflection, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>VP</u>
				17.74
			</span></i> (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προοδ-</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>receive income</i> or <i>revenue</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπό τινων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					12.8.16
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.371
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				402
			</span></i>: c. acc., <i>convert into a source of revenue, derive
				profit from</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀθλίων ἀνθρώπων
				γαστρὸς ἔνδειαν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				389
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				172
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς τύχας τοῦ ὁμοφύλου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					4.8.25
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be received as revenue,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				22.1080
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>BC</u>
				4.5
			</span></i>; also, <i>to be subject to tribute</i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				15.5.3
			</span></i>.</div>
